peded by the crowd, indicating confidence and control.\",\n          \"quote\": \"the intruder, who, at the moment was also near at hand, and now, with deliberate and stately step, made closer approach to the speaker.\",\n          \"position\": 11743,\n          \"confidence\": \"high\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"statement\": \"The mummer's presence causes the prince and others to fall dead, indicating a direct and fatal impact of his actions.\",\n          \"quote\": \"afterwards, fell prostrate in death the Prince Prospero.\",\n          \"position\": 13136,\n          \"confidence\": \"high\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"statement\": \"The mummer is found motionless in the black apartment, wearing grave cerements, confirming his role as a literal embodiment of death.\",\n          \"quote\": \"seizing the mummer, whose tall figure stood erect and motionless within the shadow of the ebony clock, gasped in unutterable horror at finding the grave cerements and corpse-like mask which they handled...\",\n          \"position\": 13136,\n          \"confidence\": \"high\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"voice_notes\": null,\n      \"first_appearance_chapter\": 1,\n      \"mention_count\": 4,\n      \"confidence\": \"high\",\n      \"is_narrator\": false,\n      \"narrative_role\": null\n    }\n  ],\n  \"pronunciations\": [\n    {\n      \"word\": \"Prospero\",\n      \"flag_reason\": \"proper_noun\",\n      \"occurrences\": 18,\n      \"first_position\": 631,\n      \"chapter_indices\": [\n        1\n      ],\n      \"context_examples\": [\n        \"...izure, progress and termination of the disease, were the incidents of half an hour. But the Prince Prospero was happy and dauntless and sagacious. When his dominions were half depopulated, he summoned to his...\",\n        \"...sixth month of his seclusion, and while the pestilence raged most furiously abroad, that the Prince Prospero entertained his thousand friends at a masked ball of the most unusual ma